  "bio": "Andrea Sparkley is an exceptionally skilled tattoo artist based in Bassano del Grappa, Italy, known for her precision and attention to detail on her black and gray, tribal style tattoos. Andrea runs her own studio, Sparkley Tattoo Studio, and is also a resident guest artist at Dragon Tattoo Studio 78, showcasing her talent and mastery in the tattoo industry.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Bassano Del Grappa, Veneto, Italy\n\nCHICANO /BLACK&GRAY\n🎨 •@sparkley_streetart  \n⚓️•ITALY🇮🇹@sparkleytattoostudio \n⚓️•IBIZA🇪🇸 @tintanegra_tattooibiza",
